    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      458.95,
      286.69,
      549.44
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: 02 allotments of land in total extent of 0.0078 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 01-02 in preliminary plan No. P. P. Maha 6341 prepared by Surveyer General situated in the Village of Katugastota and in the Divisional Secrtary\u2019s Division of Kandy and Gangawata Korale in Kandy District Central Province.",
