      445.75,
      542.2,
      597.68
    ],
    "text": "Total : 0.0078 Hectare All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawatta Korale on the 05th day of August 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th day of July 2015 the nature of their interests in the Land the particulas of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said Land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
